      "step": 2,
      "name": "串記劇本",
      "minutes": 2,
      "content": "describe 描寫，inscribe 刻寫進去，proscribe 明文禁止，prescribe 開處方／規定。script 劇本，manuscript 手稿，subscribe 署名訂閱，transcribe 轉寫，ascribe 歸因寫到誰頭上，circumscribe 劃界限制，scribble 亂寫，conscript 徵召寫入名單，postscript 又及。"
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "name": "詞卡 round",
